    (h3 : ResEta D χS S.rank) (h4 : ResEta D χW W.rank) : ∃ ω : WRep S W, IsWeil ψ ε S W χS χW ω := by
  obtain ⟨om, h⟩ := hP D ψ (sgn ε S) W χS χW hψ h1 h2 h3 h4
